34
00:02:08,438 --> 00:02:13,260
Another explosion called Geminga
occurred roughly 300,000 years ago

35
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:16,782
at a distance of 550 light-years.

36
00:02:17,769 --> 00:02:20,320
The closest known white dwarf candidate,

37
00:02:20,320 --> 00:02:25,080
IK Pegasi, is currently
moving away to a safe

38
00:02:25,080 --> 00:02:25,900
